    "audio_id": "4992_41797_000025_000006",
    "source_file": "4.src.wav",
    "reference_file": "4.ref.wav",
    "transcript": "Oh, mother, there's always so much spare room in your heart,--for you took in Julia and yet we never felt the difference,--won't you make a place for Olive?",
